  std_hookabi_lib.pcpp - std compliance: the static C library std_hookabi.pcpp
  hooks into

  A `module lib` holding only C: std_hookabi_c.c, whose two functions call
  fopen and stat. std_hookabi.pcpp links it (external "std_hookabi_lib") and
  defines link-time hooks for both names, which must bind the calls inside
  this archive too. It builds and is not run: std_hookabi.pcpp holds the
  output to expect.
*******************************************************************************/

module lib std_hookabi_lib;

/*
